      "problem": "Calculate $\\det(A),$ if ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14272902/assets/b9b7d8cdae3cd868d67b78c6bc91aa8cb1ac58350825228ba6a8348c051d0a40.svg)",
      "worked_solution": "For a $2 \\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14272902/assets/e16f4aeebc01208bccc6007ad3f0ed522cca8002f8c8a332624d11b57aefcdec.svg)\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A) & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 \\\\ 5 & 6\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3\\cdot 6-2\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =18-10 \\\\  & =8\\end{aligned}\n$$",
